                <pb facs="0272" n="184" sameAs="frus:frus1904/pg184"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hay to Mr.
                            Conger.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1904-12-06"><hi rendition="#italic">December 6,
                        1904</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Hay states that for the present and pending future arrangement of the
                    payment of the indemnity it is preferred that the United States should not be
                    placed in an exceptional position.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
